<Base title="Security" description="How to report a security vulnerability in khensu.nu.">
  <p class="eyebrow">Security</p>
  <h1>Report a vulnerability</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    If you find a security problem in khensu.nu, its network or these sites, email
    <a href="mailto:security@elliottwave.studio">security@elliottwave.studio</a>. Please don’t open a public issue.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Include what you found, how to reproduce it, and what an attacker could do with it.</li>
    <li>We’ll acknowledge your report within three working days and keep you updated until it’s fixed.</li>
    <li>We won’t take legal action against good-faith research that avoids harming users and gives us time to fix the problem before you publish.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The cryptography, protocol and app are reviewed by independent outside experts.</p>
  <p class="footnote">Machine-readable contact: <a href="/.well-known/security.txt">/.well-known/security.txt</a></p>
</Base>
